CM EFQW_160M.NEC — End-Fed Quarter-Wave Vertical, 160 Meters
CM TM-EF-NEC-001 Rev A
CM
CM Geometry: quarter-wave vertical wire over real ground
CM           with 4 quarter-wave radials at ground level
CM Feed: segment 1 of wire 1 (base = end-fed point)
CM Ground: Sommerfeld-Norton real ground (average soil)
CM
CM Band:       160m (1.800 – 2.000 MHz)
CM Center:     1.900 MHz
CM QW length:  38.29 m (VF=0.97, #14 AWG)
CM Feed Z:     approx 35 + j0 Ω over perfect ground
CM             approx 42 + j8 Ω with 4 radials, avg ground
CM
CM Build notes:
CM   Vertical element: 38.29m #14 AWG stranded copper
CM   4× radials:       38.29m each, laid on ground surface
CM   Matching:         L-network; L=2.4uH, C=500-5000pF variable
CM   Feed:             50Ω coax with choke balun at feedpoint
CM
CM To run: xnec2c efqw_160m.nec
CM

